{"unit_id":"Li-0803__dsh-session-search#feature-1","repo":"Li-0803/dsh-session-search","commit":"923cb7e887d7f6a66322ef730b87ee90c4d60560","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-search 的功能「跨会话全文搜索」：主机端读取本地压缩会话文件，解析会话标题和 User、DeepSeek 消息，并按关键词返回匹配内容片段。 通过搜索浮窗触发，输入关键词后查看分组结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:130-158"]}
